# colophon-night
# Ghostty port of the Colophon design language, dark theme
# (~/Documents/design/DESIGN.md v0.5, section 2).
# Hue family 285-300 (plum-lavender), tinted neutrals only, one accent.
# Neutrals without a source token are new steps on the same lightness
# ladder, per the Hue Family Rule. Data hues map to their ANSI roles;
# magenta is an in-family orchid rotated from the accent.

